<title>FRANCE: Algeria seeks 125,000 tonnes optional soft wheat.</title>
<headline>Algeria seeks 125,000 tonnes optional soft wheat.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algeria on Monday launched a tender for the import of 125,000 tonnes of optional soft wheat, European grain traders said.</p>
<p>Algeria is seeking the wheat in five lots of 25,000 tonnes each for shipment between April 1 and June 15, they said.</p>
<p>Exporters have until the end of the day to submit their offers to sell, with results expected on Thursday, traders said.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
